    <bpmn:process id="W_W3657" name="W3657. Bond Release, Retrieval &amp; Closeout" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract completion/milestone; warranty expiry; bond expiry (links to W3654)
Frequency: Per bond closeout
Volume: Released bonds across the portfolio
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Finance
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), Legal (links to VS-100.3), PMO (links to VS-112), Surety/Bank, Finance (links to VS-17), Warranty Mgmt (links to VS-53)
Source: workflow W3657 — Bond Release, Retrieval &amp; Closeout</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3657_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3657_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3657_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3657_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3657_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3657_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3657_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3657_Start3" name="Contract completion/milestone; warranty expiry; bond expiry (links to W3654)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3657_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3657_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/PMO identify release-eligible bonds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/PMO identify release-eligible bonds: contract/substantial-completion milestone, customer acceptance, warranty expiry, or bond expiry; verify the release conditions in the contract/bond and obtain the beneficiary release/clearance
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / PMO / Sales
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per bond</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3657_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3657_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3657_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury execute the release: request the surety/bank to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury execute the release: request the surety/bank to release/cancel the bond and return the collateral/cash margin (W3644/W3653), release the credit-line encumbrance (links to VS-18.2), and confirm the closure in writing; manage beneficiary non-response/obstruction
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Surety/Bank
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per bond</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3657_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3657_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3657_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/Finance update the encumbrance register (W3654) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/Finance update the encumbrance register (W3654) and records (W3648), release the restricted cash/collateral in accounting (links to VS-17), and report release cycle-time and trapped-bond risk to governance (W3661); drive release discipline to minimize trapped capital
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3657_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3657_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3657_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3657_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3657_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-579 (ensure controlled execution — Bond Release, Claims, Recovery &amp; Surety Analytics (PA-116.3).) | - operational: release tracking and active closeout; operational: acceptance evidence and legal (W3660)
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3657_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3657_Annotation8" targetRef="W3657_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3657_Flow10" sourceRef="W3657_Start3" targetRef="W3657_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3657_Flow11" sourceRef="W3657_Task4" targetRef="W3657_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3657_Flow12" sourceRef="W3657_Task5" targetRef="W3657_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3657_Flow13" sourceRef="W3657_Task6" targetRef="W3657_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3657_diag">
