    <bpmn:process id="W_W3661" name="W3661. Surety Spend, Encumbrance &amp; Cost Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; governance/ExCo cycle
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Surety program spend and encumbrance
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Finance
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18), BI (links to VS-28.1), ExCo (links to VS-33.2), Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W3661 — Surety Spend, Encumbrance &amp; Cost Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3661_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3661_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3661_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3661_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3661_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3661_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3661_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3661_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; governance/ExCo cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3661_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3661_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Finance capture surety spend and encumbrance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Finance capture surety spend and encumbrance: premiums/fees by instrument/provider/contract, collateral/cash margin tied up, credit-line encumbrance (links to VS-18.2), claim/loss cost (W3658/W3659), and release-cycle trapped capital; allocate to entity/contract
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3661_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3661_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3661_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Finance analyze cost drivers and optimization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Finance analyze cost drivers and optimization: instrument mix (W3645), provider pricing, collateral vs. bond substitution, trapped-capital cost, and claim-loss trend; identify savings and risk-concentration
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3661_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3661_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3661_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager publish surety spend, encumbrance, and exposure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager publish surety spend, encumbrance, and exposure analytics to ExCo (links to VS-33.2) and the risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36), drive cost/risk optimization, and track over time; feed to facility strategy (W3642) and instrument-mix (W3641)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3661_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3661_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3661_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3661_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
