    <bpmn:process id="W_W3662" name="W3662. Surety Provider Performance &amp; Scorecard" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Provider review cycle; renewal; performance issue
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Surety providers and guarantee banks
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Treasury (links to VS-18), Procurement (links to VS-34), Finance (links to VS-17), Legal (links to VS-100.3), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3662 — Surety Provider Performance &amp; Scorecard</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3662_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3662_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3662_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3662_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3662_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3662_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3662_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3662_Start3" name="Provider review cycle; renewal; performance issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3662_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3662_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury define and instrument provider KPIs: turnaround…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Treasury define and instrument provider KPIs: turnaround (application to issuance), pricing (W3645), claim handling (W3658), capacity/flexibility, financial strength, and service quality; integrate to the vendor scorecard methodology (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3662_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3662_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3662_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury conduct periodic provider reviews: scorecard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury conduct periodic provider reviews: scorecard review with each surety/bank, performance feedback, volume/share discussion, pricing negotiation (W3645), and improvement actions; manage the provider portfolio and diversification
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3662_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3662_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3662_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager manage provider performance issues and exit/replacement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager manage provider performance issues and exit/replacement, feed to the approved-provider list (W3643), and report provider performance to governance (W3661) and procurement (links to VS-34)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Procurement
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3662_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3662_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3662_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3662_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
