        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-579 (ensure controlled execution — Bond Release, Claims, Recovery &amp; Surety Analytics (PA-116.3).) | - operational: turnaround KPI and diversification; operational: scorecard-driven diversification
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
