    <bpmn:process id="W_W3663" name="W3663. Contract / Bond Compliance &amp; Performance Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics; PMO delivery review (links to VS-112)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Bond-backed contracts and delivery performance
Owner: Surety Program Manager / PMO
Participants: Surety Program Manager, PMO (links to VS-112), B2G/B2B Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Quality (links to VS-31), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3663 — Contract / Bond Compliance &amp; Performance Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3663_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3663_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3663_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3663_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3663_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3663_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3663_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3663_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics; PMO delivery review (links to VS-112)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3663_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3663_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/PMO track bond-backed contract delivery performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/PMO track bond-backed contract delivery performance: milestone delivery vs. plan, quality/acceptance, default-risk indicators, warranty performance (links to VS-53), and the bond-utilization profile; identify at-risk contracts (default/claim exposure)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / PMO / BI
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3663_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3663_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3663_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/PMO analyze the bond-claim/default drivers: contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/PMO analyze the bond-claim/default drivers: contract type, customer (government vs. private), project complexity, delivery issues, and external factors; identify systemic risk and feed to contract-risk assessment (W3646) and go/no-go (links to VS-46)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / PMO / Legal / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3663_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3663_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3663_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager report contract/bond compliance and delivery performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager report contract/bond compliance and delivery performance to governance (W3661), the risk committee (links to VS-21.2), and ExCo (links to VS-33.2); drive corrective action on at-risk contracts and prevention on future bids
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3663_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3663_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3663_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3663_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3663_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-579 (ensure controlled execution — Bond Release, Claims, Recovery &amp; Surety Analytics (PA-116.3).) | - operational: performance tracking and early intervention; operational: driver analysis and go/no-go discipline
Owner: Surety Program Manager / PMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3663_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3663_Annotation8" targetRef="W3663_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3663_Flow10" sourceRef="W3663_Start3" targetRef="W3663_Task4" />
