    <bpmn:process id="W_W3664" name="W3664. Surety Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual cycle; strategy refresh (W3641); audit; opportunity
Frequency: Annual + on opportunity
Volume: Surety program
Owner: Surety Program Manager
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Audit (links to VS-21), Treasury (links to VS-18), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Risk (links to VS-21.2), ExCo (links to VS-33.2), Innovation/IT (links to VS-30/VS-27)
Source: workflow W3664 — Surety Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3664_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3664_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3664_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3664_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3664_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3664_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3664_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3664_Start3" name="Annual cycle; strategy refresh (W3641); audit; opportunity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3664_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3664_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Audit assess surety-program maturity: governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Audit assess surety-program maturity: governance (W3641), facility/provider management (W3642/W3643), encumbrance accuracy (W3654), release discipline (W3657), cost optimization (W3645), claim handling (W3658), records (W3648), and analytics maturity (W3661); benchmark to good practice
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3664_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3664_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3664_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager identify improvements and innovation: digital bond…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager identify improvements and innovation: digital bond platforms (e-surety / PhilGEPS electronic bid security), automation of encumbrance/release tracking, integration to contract/PMO systems, predictive claim-risk, and instrument-mix optimization; prioritize and resource via the PMO (links to VS-112)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Innovation / IT
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual + on opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3664_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3664_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3664_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager report program maturity, improvement progress, and value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager report program maturity, improvement progress, and value to ExCo (links to VS-33.2) and the board/risk committee (links to VS-36), and feed learnings to strategy (W3641), facility (W3642), and policy (W3647); drive continuous improvement
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3664_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3664_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3664_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3664_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3664_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-579 (ensure controlled execution — Bond Release, Claims, Recovery &amp; Surety Analytics (PA-116.3).) | - operational: digital platforms and automation; operational: independent audit input
Owner: Surety Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
